stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED : addDownload()
    QUEUED --> DOWNLOADING : queue slot available
    DOWNLOADING --> PAUSED : user pauses manually
    PAUSED --> DOWNLOADING : user resumes
    DOWNLOADING --> RECONNECTING : network failure
    RECONNECTING --> DOWNLOADING : reconnect succeeded
    RECONNECTING --> FAILED : max_retries exceeded
    DOWNLOADING --> COMPLETED : all segments completed and checksum passed
    DOWNLOADING --> FAILED : unrecoverable error, e.g. 404
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED : user cancels
    DOWNLOADING --> CANCELLED : user cancels
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED : user cancels
    FAILED --> QUEUED : manual retry
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

